<h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
<p class="page-lead">Customer details in this system are demonstration data for the cloud practical.</p>
<div class="panel">
    <p>Customer names, emails, phone numbers, and addresses are stored in your Azure Storage account. The storage connection string is configuration, not source code.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Product images stay in a private blob container. The website streams them through the application instead of making the container public.</p>
</div>
